<body>
<header><nav class="wrap" aria-label="Main navigation"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Groxen home"><img src="/images/groxen-app-icon.png" alt="Groxen app logo"><span>Groxen</span></a><div class="links"><a href="#features">How it works</a><a href="#data-use">Data use</a><a class="privacy" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy policy</a><a href="/admin">Login</a></div></nav></header>
<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your neighbourhood marketplace</p><h1>Everyday essentials, closer to home.</h1><p class="lead">Groxen is a shopping and delivery app that connects customers with local sellers for groceries, fresh produce, dairy, household supplies, stationery, pet care and other everyday essentials.</p><div class="buttons"><a class="button" href="#features">Explore Groxen</a><a class="button alt" href="/privacy-policy">Read our privacy policy</a></div></div><div class="art" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/groxen-app-icon.png" alt=""></div></div></section>
<section id="features"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">What the app does</p><h2>Shopping made simple from search to doorstep.</h2><p>Customers can discover nearby products and offers, order from participating vendors, choose a delivery address and payment option, and follow each order through fulfilment.</p></div><div class="cards">
<article class="card"><div class="icon">⌕</div><h3>Browse and discover</h3><p>Search products, explore categories, compare available choices and view local promotions.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">▣</div><h3>Order securely</h3><p>Add items to your cart, manage delivery addresses, apply eligible offers and select an available payment method.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">⌖</div><h3>Delivery updates</h3><p>Receive order-status notifications, view fulfilment progress and use location features for serviceability and delivery.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">♡</div><h3>Account and preferences</h3><p>Create and manage your profile, saved addresses, order history, favourites and communication preferences.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">★</div><h3>Ratings and support</h3><p>Rate completed orders, contact support and share information needed to resolve an order or account issue.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">₹</div><h3>Payments and refunds</h3><p>Review charges and invoices, access supported payment options, and track eligible refunds or wallet activity.</p></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="data" id="data-use"><div class="wrap data-grid"><div class="data-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Transparent data use</p><h2>Why Groxen asks for your information.</h2><p>We request only the information and device permissions needed to provide, secure and improve our shopping and delivery services. Optional permissions are requested when you use the related feature.</p><p class="policy">For retention, sharing, security and your rights, read the complete <a href="/privacy-policy">Groxen Privacy Policy</a>.</p></div><div class="data-list">
<div class="data-item"><strong>Identity and contact information</strong><span>Name, phone number, email address and account identifiers are used to create your account, sign you in, send service messages and provide support. If you choose Google Sign-In, basic profile information shared with your permission is used for authentication.</span></div>
<div class="data-item"><strong>Address and location</strong><span>Delivery addresses and, with permission, device location help determine service availability, assign the correct delivery area, calculate delivery charges and support order delivery.</span></div>
<div class="data-item"><strong>Orders and payments</strong><span>Cart, order, invoice, transaction-reference, refund and wallet information is used to process purchases and maintain accurate records. Sensitive payment credentials are handled by payment providers.</span></div>
<div class="data-item"><strong>Camera, photos and files</strong><span>When you choose these features, access supports profile photos, receipts and attachments you send to customer support.</span></div>
<div class="data-item"><strong>Device, usage and diagnostics</strong><span>Device identifiers, notification tokens, logs and app interactions help deliver alerts, keep sessions secure, prevent misuse, diagnose errors and improve performance.</span></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="about"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">About Groxen</p><h2>A local-commerce service built for everyday needs.</h2><p>Groxen is operated by Shining Universal Organisation Private Limited. The customer app works alongside participating vendors and delivery partners to make local ordering and fulfilment easier.</p></div><div><div class="fact"><strong>Service</strong>Local marketplace, ordering and delivery coordination</div><div class="fact"><strong>Operator</strong>Shining Universal Organisation Private Limited</div><div class="fact"><strong>Privacy contact</strong><a href="mailto:support@groxen.com">support@groxen.com</a></div></div></div></section>
</main>
<footer><div class="wrap foot"><div><strong>Groxen</strong><br>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Shining Universal Organisation Private Limited.</div><div class="footlinks"><a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/content-pages/client/terms-and-conditions">Terms &amp; Conditions</a><a href="mailto:support@groxen.com">Contact</a><a href="/admin">Login</a></div></div></footer>
</body></html>
